C: box "C" fit


OP: box "Operand &larr;" fit at 2cm right of C.e

text "ROL" bold at 0.75cm north of OP

arrow from OP.w to C.e
dot at 0.5cm west of OP.w
arrow from last dot up 0.5cm then right 3cm  then down until even with OP.e then right to OP.e






OP2: box "Operand &rarr;" fit at 2cm south of OP
text "ROR" bold at 0.75cm north of OP2



C2: box "C" fit at 2.25cm right of OP2
arrow from OP2.e to C2.w
dot at 0.5cm east of OP2.e
arrow from last dot up 0.5cm then left 3cm then down until even with OP2.w then right to OP2.w